      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Hi @{636f97bb1141b34d7a6df4c3|full_name}! To clarify, are you referring to *pickups* not respecting the `DefaultExecutionOrder` property? Or are you referring to `DefaultExecutionOrder` not working as expected *in general*?\n\nAFAIK `DefaultExecutionOrder` is not intended as a way to prioritize pickup selection. But that would be an interesting feature request! Perhaps pickups should have their own `PickupPriority` value?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
