      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} There are no pickups here. Teal doesn't use VRCPickup.\n\nThe issue is that instantiated behaviors don't respect execution order.\n\nNormally the `InputGrab` events would fire according to the execution order.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
