      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} Hi! Like KitKat mentioned, no VRC_Pickups are being used, I've setup my own custom pickup solution using triggers and InputGrab!\n\nAFAIK Inputs only register if the script is enabled, so I'd assume these are run in some internal Update method.\n\nThe DefaultExecutionOrder should still apply",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
