      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} Ahh okay! \n\nI think I will probably come up with my own solution to fix this, I don't think other creators will end up with this issue, so I doubt a feature request would be too useful here.\n\nThank you for looking into it, I was curious what had happened!",
