      "value": "Thank you for the clarification!\n\nThis has been reported as a bug, but the original behavior is not something that was intended. As such, it's not something we can easily implement.\n\nPlease feel free to resubmit this as a feature request! That'll make it easier for us to consider it as a feature in the future.",
